entTests gutter test to resolve StaticResource margins from Themes/Spacing.xaml, where T853 moved the spacing scale out of App.xaml (M.ORCH-T895); b90330cd Make the resource-names test follow App.xaml''s merged dictionaries (Themes/Spacing.xaml) (M.ORCH-T894); e4852036 Subscribe the dashboard to the app bus: ticket ids open in a listening Tickets Desktop over the bus, Tickets Desktop''s "show who is working X" selects that person and CLI tab, and ticket events refresh the Queue instead of a poll (M.ORCH-T879); 94705792 Carry ticket events on the status bus: the daemon publishes every ticket change from the ticket database''s change feed, and the Orchestrator publishes its own claims and releases as it makes them (M.ORCH-T879); bc6d311f Flash the person tab''s status icon as a pause once every open CLI of that login is idle (no turn, subagent, claim or prompt, judged as orchestrator busy does), steady green play while any works, steady pause with none open; opacity pulse honours reduced motion, word kept in tooltip and accessible name (M.ORCH-T890); a395638b Lay pushed snapshot figures straight onto the dashboard and drop its stream-up poll to a 5-minute heartbeat (M.ORCH-T872); b33ddd15 Give the daemon a status inbox the hooks write to directly, instead of it noticing their files (M.ORCH-T872); 9c54d60e Carry each snapshot''s own figures on the status stream in an extensible kind/version/payload envelope (M.ORCH-T872); 11ddc58a Expect the Queue status strip in the tab-strip test: QueueStatusTabs (M.ORCH-T849) is a bare library MaTabControl with no colour of its own (M.ORCH-T887); 2aceb918 Add a Tickets button beside the dashboard''s settings cog: Segoe''s Tag glyph (E8EC) in MaToolButton style, "Open Tickets" tooltip and automation name; it brings a running Tickets Desktop''s window forward (by process main window handle, TerminalFocus.Foreground) or starts the installed exe (C:\Apps or %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs, where MindAttic.Tickets/deploy.ps1 puts it), and toasts