tead of it noticing their files (M.ORCH-T872); 9c54d60e Carry each snapshot''s own figures on the status stream in an extensible kind/version/payload envelope (M.ORCH-T872); 11ddc58a Expect the Queue status strip in the tab-strip test: QueueStatusTabs (M.ORCH-T849) is a bare library MaTabControl with no colour of its own (M.ORCH-T887))', 'duplicate of M.ORCH-T907..T921 (fixed in 833e8d84; this run at 2e17a7e9 predates it)', 947, NULL);
