- One enemy walking 6 tiles through the cone with 3 shots available draws shots at entry, after 2 tiles and after 4 tiles, not one per square.
- With two enemies in the cone, the second one gets shot before the first is shot again.');

Engine facts (Code.dll, `OverwatchController`):
- `PartOverwatch` is zone-based: it fires at any enemy whose cells are in `OverwatchArea`. Triggers come from `HandleEntityPositionChanged` (every position update, likely many per move) and `HandleUnitCommandDidAct` (abilities with `UsingInOverwatchArea: WillCauseAttack`).
- Mode only controls whether the part `Stop()`s after a shot; `HitManyTimes` lets the same unit be shot again.

